      "width": 3072,
      "height": 2304,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "Public domain",
      "artist": "NPS",
      "description": "View from a campsite in Voyageurs National Park\nYour boat lets you reach the over 270 front country campsites at Voyageur’s. Each of the sites is secluded and offers the chance to experience the quiet beauty of the north woods. Many of the campsites occupy their own island and some even their own lake in the backcountry sites!\nKeywords: nps centennial; media quality",
